,"source":["## 🏅 Celda 9 — Selección Natural: Top 5 supervivientes\n","Selecciona los 5 mejores individuos **leyendo únicamente los nombres de las carpetas** guardadas en Drive, sin reentrenar ningún modelo. Esto aplica directamente el principio de selección natural."]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"rep8QjvWZQeW","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1773211176813,"user_tz":360,"elapsed":17,"user":{"displayName":"CHRISTIAN ADBEL ISLAS REYES","userId":"14850796498485429167"}},"outputId":"8f2f2168-27c0-40dc-cef7-30d5829cda02"},"source":["ruta_gen = f\"{BASE_DIR}/generacion_{generacion}\"\n","carpetas = [f for f in os.listdir(ruta_gen) if f.startswith(\"RNC_\")]\n","\n","def extraer_accuracy(nombre):\n","    try:\n","        return int(nombre.split(\"_ACC\")[-1]) / 10000\n","    except:\n","        return 0\n","\n","carpetas_ordenadas = sorted(carpetas, key=extraer_accuracy, reverse=True)\n","top5 = carpetas_ordenadas[:5]\n","\n","filas = []\n","for i, nombre in enumerate(top5):\n","    filas.append({\n","        'Rank': i + 1,\n","        'Capas': nombre.split(\"_L\")[1].split(\"_\")[0],\n","        'Neuronas': nombre.split(\"_N\")[1].split(\"_\")[0],\n","        'Kernels': nombre.split(\"_K\")[1].split(\"_\")[0],\n","        'Batch': nombre.split(\"_BATCH\")[1].split(\"_\")[0],\n","        'Activación': nombre.split(\"_BATCH\")[1].split(\"_\")[1],\n","        'Val Accuracy': extraer_accuracy(nombre)\n","    })\n","\n","df_top5 = pd.DataFrame(filas)\n","\n","print(\"=\" * 75)\n","print(\"🏆 TOP 5 — SUPERVIVIENTES SELECCIONADOS PARA SIGUIENTE GENERACIÓN\")\n","print(\"=\" * 75)\n","print(df_top5.to_string(index=False))\n","print(\"\\nEstos individuos serían los 'padres' de la Generación 2.\")"],"execution_count":9,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["===========================================================================\n","🏆 TOP 5 — SUPERVIVIENTES SELECCIONADOS PARA SIGUIENTE GENERACIÓN\n","===========================================================================\n"," Rank Capas Neuronas Kernels Batch Activación  Val Accuracy\n","    1     3      128     128    64       RELU        0.9929\n","    2     3      128      64    32       RELU        0.9923\n","    3     3       64     128    32       RELU        0.9921\n","    4     2      128      64    32       RELU        0.9919\n","    5     3       64      64    32       RELU        0.9917\n","\n","Estos individuos serían los 'padres' de la Generación 2.\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"rBYJuvksZQeW"},"source":["## 🔢 Celda 10 — Predicciones de los Top 5\n","Carga cada uno de los 5 mejores modelos desde Drive y genera predicciones sobre dígitos del conjunto de prueba. Verde = correcto, Rojo = incorrecto.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":1000},"id":"XbRcjbjrZQeX","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1773211180708,"user_tz":360,"elapsed":3890,"user":{"displayName":"CHRISTIAN ADBEL ISLAS REYES","userId":"14850796498485429167"}},"outputId":"482cdc24-f424-4a98-d97c-7a87ab524fd1"},"source":["fig, axes = plt.subplots(5, 10, figsize=(20, 11))\n","fig.suptitle(\"Top 5 Supervivientes — Predicciones sobre dígitos de prueba\",\n","             fontsize=13, fontweight='bold', y=1.01)\n","\n","np.random.seed(42)\n","indices = np.random.choice(len(x_test), 10, replace=False)\n","\n","for row, nombre in enumerate(top5):\n","    carpeta_modelo = f\"{ruta_gen}/{nombre}\"\n","    try:\n","        model_cargado = tf.keras.models.load_model(carpeta_modelo)\n","        predicciones  = model_cargado.predict(x_test[indices], verbose=0)\n","        preds         = np.argmax(predicciones, axis=1)\n","        usar_pred     = True\n","    except:\n","        usar_pred = False\n","\n","    acc_val = extraer_accuracy(nombre)\n","    label_y = f\"#{row+1}  ACC={acc_val:.4f}\\n{nombre.split('_ACC')[0].replace('RNC_','')}\"\n","\n","    for col, idx in enumerate(indices):\n","        ax = axes[row, col]\n","        ax.imshow(x_test[idx].squeeze(), cmap='gray')\n","        if usar_pred:\n","            pred  = preds[col]\n","            real  = y_test[idx]\n","            color = 'green' if pred == real else 'red'\n","            ax.set_title(f\"P:{pred} R:{real}\", fontsize=7, color=color)\n","        else:\n","            ax.set_title(f\"y={y_test[idx]}\", fontsize=7)\n","        ax.axis('off')\n","\n","    axes[row, 0].set_ylabel(label_y, fontsize=6.5, rotation=0,\n","                             labelpad=135, va='center')\n","\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","img_path = f\"{BASE_DIR}/top5_predicciones.png\"\n","plt.savefig(img_path, dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\n","plt.show()\n","print(f\"✅ Imagen guardada: {img_path}\")\n","print(\"Verde = predicción correcta | Rojo = predicción incorrecta\")"],"execution_count":10,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 2000x1100 with 50 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["✅ Imagen guardada: /content/drive/MyDrive/AG_CNN_MNIST/top5_predicciones.png\n","Verde = predicción correcta | Rojo = predicción incorrecta\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"6U3ottcDZQeX"},"source":["## 💾 Celda 11 — Exportar CSVs con resultados"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":71},"id":"1o8W4HqRZQeX","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1773211180756,"user_tz":360,"elapsed":42,"user":{"displayName":"CHRISTIAN ADBEL ISLAS REYES","userId":"14850796498485429167"}},"outputId":"41da395d-81a8-4637-f43d-b3f3d44ab7bf"},"source":["csv_todos = f\"{BASE_DIR}/resultados_generacion_{generacion}.csv\"\n","df.to_csv(csv_todos, index=False)\n","print(f\"📄 Tabla completa: {csv_todos}\")\n","\n","csv_top5 = f\"{BASE_DIR}/top5_generacion_{generacion}.csv\"\n","df_top5.to_csv(csv_top5, index=False)\n","print(f\"🏅 Top 5: {csv_top5}\")\n","\n","from google.col